# a beat on track 1: the kick on 1 5 9 13, the snare on 5 and 13, hats on every other step
wait 200
expect page Steps
tapkey w0
tapkey w4
tapkey w8
tapkey w12
wait 40
shot beat_kick.png
# the snare: black key 2 picks the sound
tapkey b1
tapkey w4
tapkey w12
tapkey b2
tapkey w0
tapkey w2
tapkey w4
tapkey w6
tapkey w8
tapkey w10
tapkey w12
tapkey w14
wait 40
shot beat_hats.png
steps 1 1
tap PLAY
expect playing 1
wait 1200
shot beat_playing.png
leds
# a component on step 7: hold it, press black key 3 (multiply), set its value with K4
key w6 down
wait 100
shot step_held.png
tapkey b2
spin K4 2
wait 40
shot step_component.png
key w6 up
expect comp 1 7 3
wait 1500
tap PLAY
expect playing 0
